Z||000000||firstfiero||02-11-2001||11:55 AM||||     Pulled up beside a Mustang gt last night. I knew he was faster then me but I just wanted to find out how much faster <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> ....It turns out I only lost by about quarter car length.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> not to shabby. Specialy when I got home i found out my rear tire only had 15 pda of preasure in it. I'm sure that didn't help my hook up real well. The guy gave my a smile and a nod when we got to the next light...I think he was surprised what a fiero v6 can do! Oh well...I still haven't lost to a ricer!!! anybody out their have any experience racing 5.0s? It was one of the early 90 boxy ones.  86se||||reg||9
