Z||000021||danny boy||02-14-2001||10:32 PM||||oh, nevermind. I am not a ricer. I knew what everybody was talking about. I laugh at those guys too. 450HP exaust tips and all.<BR>Everyone has their own definition of fast; what most people think is fast doesnt impress me much-Hondas,a lot of Fieros, Mustangs,etc. And I'm sure what I consider fast doesent impress a lot of people. Such is life. Sorry about the rant.But seriously, if anyone wants to come to Hagerstown or Keystone dragway(Greensburg,PA) this season I'll be there.||||reg||1
Z||000022||filthyscarecrow||02-14-2001||11:37 PM||||the problem here is that you assume that i'm a ricer. i'm not even close. my car has 2 stickers on it: one that sez university of minnesota, and one that sez skip barber racing school. the reason being that i am an alumnus of both. the reason i have a "rice burner" is because, well, look at the gas pumps! dear god you're having to reach up your ass to pay for petrol these days. my fiero gets 21mpg, my integra gets almost 35mpg and goes just as fast. i thought it was a pretty sensible thing to buy, while still being fun. it will never look like the cars you see in those magazines just because i think they look silly. they have all these aero mods that do nothing but look silly and add weight. doyou REALLY think a wing does anything to change the handling of a 2600lb street car at anywhere under 80mph? if you do, you might want to seriously consider reading a few books on the subject. the only mods that i make to my car are performance mods. just like you guys do. i vowed that my car will never have an exhaust tip bigger then 3 inches too. i think the coffee cans look silly, and they sure as hell don't make it go any faster. <BR>you guys who pick on ricers need to seriously look at yourselves. we're quite fond of cars that, aside from us, not many people take seriously. but magically somehow, because they're ricers, and you're fiero fanatics it makes it okay for you to put them down. i'm not a ricer, but i dno't think they deserve the crap that people give them. just like you don't deserve the crap people give you about fieros. <BR>||||reg||1
